s effectively wider in 1/K0 at high mobility. That's a science change, not just a data-structure change — and it changes which peaks join traces. The design asserts it's "the same mistake as a fixed ppm halo" to keep it constant across frames — but doesn't justify why per-frame variability of the 1/K0-per-scan spacing matters when the tolerance is defined in 1/K0 and imq is already in 1/K0.

